# Upstream model pins for install.sh (sourced by bash; keep it plain KEY="value").
#
# Empty means "use whatever Hugging Face has right now". install.sh then prints
# the commits and checksums it actually used and saves them to
# <build workspace>/resolved-pins.env. Paste those values here and commit, and
# every later build (on any Mac) converts exactly the same weights, or stops
# with a clear error if the downloaded files don't match.
#
#   ULTRA_REVISION            moondream/parakeet-ultra commit SHA
#   ULTRA_SAFETENSORS_SHA256  sha256 of that commit's model.safetensors
#   BASE_REVISION             nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3 commit SHA
#   BASE_NEMO_SHA256          sha256 of that commit's .nemo file
#
# PARAKEET_ULTRA_REVISION and PARAKEET_ULTRA_BASE_REVISION in the environment
# override the two revisions for a one-off build. When a revision is overridden,
# its checksum pin here is ignored, since it belongs to a different commit.

ULTRA_REVISION=""
ULTRA_SAFETENSORS_SHA256=""
BASE_REVISION=""
BASE_NEMO_SHA256=""
